{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You weren\u2019t always a male escort.<br>You were just someone behind the bar \u2014 a smooth-talking bartender with nothing but a shaker in your hand and a dream too dangerous to say out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until she walked in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loretta.<br>A bestselling author. Powerful. Polished. Controlled.<br>She hires you\u2014not for pleasure, but as a source. She wants to hear your story for her next novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/9d4d8dbe6bf47eaf8e629de695ffd859.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your story isn't just about sex. It's about power, temptation, and what happens when you fall too deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You tell her about Maria\u2014your stunning, fearless boss. The woman who owns the bar... and nearly owns your heart. You talk about the jealous ex she couldn't quite shake, and how that drama almost pulls you under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/f139ba0d556a798dfc20d7de05f5696d.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there\u2019s Vankra \u2014 the charming, nerdy girl with a dirty laugh and the ability to make your pulse race just by looking at you. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/33e5f509ae7089b09d5e817e07369c53.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course\u2026 Aurae.<br>Bold. Aggressive. Unapologetic. She didn\u2019t flirt \u2014 she hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/2421eaeae7f50ec3b26714d041d97893.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And we can't forget about all the other important women whomst story will be told on another time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kala, the wife of a powerful mafia boss who seems to have everything, but behind closed doors, her influential, dominant husband can\u2019t satisfy her. By his permission she seeks out for you\u2014someone who can give her the pleasure and excitement her marriage can't provide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/aa9fa2d55b3baf6758acdae1e4177659.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Svara, the cutie who entertains you on her live stream every other night. A girl you can only look at but can't touch. You can't get enough of her. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/a2b490c55973365cb7bd692ec0b54438.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova, a supermodel, boasting a beautiful face and slender body, and a wild side you can't really ignore. She teases and gets in to your head\u2014it's driving you crazy. But apart from all of that, she cares a lot about her sister, Vankra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/41750ff2de6d07360cf5b83cae6e7171.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elara, the woman who stands behind the scene. With her elegance and power, she controls and runs the escort business.\u00a0But behind all the glitz and glamour, she finds herself longing for something real\u2014something money can\u2019t buy\u2014something that can fill the loneliness in her heart.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/da1345c3c7666de02a55adcea64b7e61.avif?t=1768027665\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you share each memory, Loretta listens. But something starts to change.<br>She\u2019s no longer just taking notes. She\u2019s leaning in. She\u2019s fantasizing. She\u2019s unraveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing about your encounters drives her wild \u2014 until she can no longer hide the dark, forbidden hunger inside her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought you were just telling your story.<br>But you\u2019re becoming part of hers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is only the beginning.</strong><br><i>Lust By Appointment: Prologue</i> is your first step into a world of erotic power plays, twisted relationships, and dangerous desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to confess\u2026 <i>everything</i>?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hot Geek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822270/904668af5db16975419f4aefa25319bbd29099c8.jpg"},{"name":"Room Tour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822270/0fb5a53377984d73b4b3d01bf4e9d5a3104ff18d.jpg"},{"name":"Accidental Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822270/465290ebd1c401c12f452d46f7ec428291ca9139.jpg"},{"name":"#1 Fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822270/5fa8ca1de85525d3917ec4e247c64d6d31a89eea.jpg"},{"name":"A New Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822